    "updated_at": "2016-05-09T05:42:51Z",
    "body": "I'm pretty sure we're not following that bit of the spec either. The lack of `allow-top-navigation` blocks `window.top.location = whatever`, but does not block `window.open(whatever)` in the presence of `allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-popups` (see https://code.google.com/p/chromium/codesearch#chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/frame/Frame.cpp&rcl=1462749575&l=183, which is more or less the only check against that flag).\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
