    "updated_at": "2016-05-09T14:26:57Z",
    "body": "Note that the open question here is what behaviors _should be_ allowed.\n\nIt seems like we have to allow `window.open(url)` to work somehow in the `allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox` case.  Do we need to allow renavigating that window once it's been opened?  Do we need to allow navigating any other windows?\n",
