    "created_at": "2016-09-07T21:00:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-07T21:00:37Z",
    "body": "So what would be the problem with simply setting the one permitted sandboxed navigator on the popup even in the allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox case?  Why did Chrome not take this approach?  @mikewest \n",
