    "created_at": "2016-09-08T04:18:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-08T04:18:06Z",
    "body": "After some internal discussion, Gecko will probably be shipping the behavior where we set the one permitted sandboxed navigator even when allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox is used.  It doesn't introduce the security issue that Chrome's approach seems to.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
