    "created_at": "2016-09-09T14:13:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-09T14:13:27Z",
    "body": "The \"sandboxed navigation browsing context flag\" if always set if any flags at all are set.  So there is no need to test for \"not empty\".  Just do two tests:\n1.  If the \"sandboxed navigation browsing context flag\" is set, then the current browsing context must be set as the new browsing context's one permitted sandboxed navigator.\n2. If the \"sandbox propagates to auxiliary browsing contexts flag\" is set, then copy the flags  (Note that your proposed text has this test backwards).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
